    "features": {
      "type":"suntneew-pdp-story",
      "blocks": {
        "overview":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-01-overview.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 portable car jump starter overview","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"U32 overview","heading":"A larger display for the moment your vehicle will not start.","body":"<p>U32 brings emergency starting, device power and a practical roadside light together. The original product information keeps <strong>10,000mAh / 37Wh</strong>, <strong>2,000A peak</strong> and <strong>1,000A starting current</strong> visible at a glance.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "specifications":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-02-specifications.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 verified product specifications","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Verified essentials","heading":"The numbers that matter, in one view.","body":"<p>U32 is specified at <strong>150 × 75 × 25mm</strong> and <strong>480g</strong>, with ABS+PC housing, PD 18W Type-C recharging and a 5W emergency light. See the full Specifications panel for port limits and safe-use guidance.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "starting":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-03-starting.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 starting performance for compatible 12V vehicles","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Starting performance","heading":"Built for the compatible 12V vehicle.","body":"<p>The documented engine reference is up to <strong>6.5L Gas</strong> or <strong>3.5L Diesel</strong>. The <strong>30+ starts</strong> reference is based on an internal 1.6L test vehicle at 23°C; battery health, temperature and vehicle condition affect results.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "smart_clamp":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-04-smart-clamp.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 intelligent smart clamp protection","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Smart clamp guidance","heading":"A clear connection routine, built into the clamp.","body":"<p>The EC5 smart clamp uses a heavy-duty <strong>10AWG cable</strong> with buzzer and status guidance. Confirm the connection, wait for the green indication and follow the four-step sequence in the manual.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "temperature":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-05-temperature.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 operating temperature range","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"All-season readiness","heading":"Designed for cold starts and hot-road days.","body":"<p>U32 has a documented operating temperature range of <strong>-20°C–60°C</strong>. Keep the unit clean and dry, and do not rinse or use it as a waterproof device.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "capacity":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-06-capacity.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 10000mAh capacity feature","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Stored energy","heading":"Power that stays ready between trips.","body":"<p>The 10,000mAh / 37Wh battery supports repeated roadside readiness and everyday USB device power. Recharge after use and at least once every three months during long-term storage.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "safeguards":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-07-safeguards.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 six-in-one safety safeguards","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Six visible safeguards","heading":"Protection made visible before you start.","body":"<p>The original six-in-one protection graphic is retained: reverse polarity, short circuit, over-voltage, over-current, overheat and over-discharge. U32 is presented as <strong>UL Listed/Certified</strong> to UL 2743; the model scope is shown in Safety &amp; Compliance.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "scenarios":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-08-scenarios.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 daily driving and outdoor scenarios","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Ready where you park","heading":"A small emergency kit for ordinary and unexpected stops.","body":"<p>Keep U32 accessible for commutes, road trips, outdoor weekends and low-battery moments. Inspect the clamps before use and always work with a compatible 12V vehicle battery.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "led":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-09-led.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U32 5W LED emergency light","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Emergency light","heading":"See the connection, signal the situation.","body":"<p>The <strong>5W LED</strong> has <strong>Steady, Flashing and SOS</strong> modes. Hold the power key for two seconds or double-click to turn the light on or off, then short-press to cycle modes.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "steps":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u32-2026-pdp-10-steps.jpg","image_alt":"Four U32 jump-start steps","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Four-step start","heading":"Connect deliberately. Start with confidence.","body":"<p>Charge U32 to at least 50%, insert the EC5 smart clamp, connect red to positive and black to negative, then start within 30 seconds after the clamp shows green. Disconnect once the vehicle has started.</p>","variant_match":""}}
      },
