    "faq": {
      "type":"suntneew-pdp-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Which vehicles is U32 designed to support?","answer":"<p>U32 is for compatible 12V vehicles, with a stated reference of up to 6.5L gasoline or 3.5L diesel engines. Confirm the vehicle, battery condition and manual before use.</p>"}},
        "q2":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"What does 30+ starts mean?","answer":"<p>The 30+ start reference is based on a 1.6L test vehicle at 23°C. Actual results vary with vehicle type, battery health, engine condition and temperature.</p>"}},
        "q3":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"What can the Type-C and USB-A ports do?","answer":"<p>Recharge U32 through Type-C at 5V/2A or 9V/2A PD 18W. The two USB-A ports support everyday device charging with a shared 5V/2.4A total maximum output.</p>"}},
        "q4":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"What light modes does U32 have?","answer":"<p>The 5W emergency light has Steady, Flashing and SOS modes. Hold the power key for two seconds or double-click to turn it on or off, then short-press to cycle modes.</p>"}},
        "q5":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"What safety protection does the smart clamp provide?","answer":"<p>The original 6-in-1 protection graphic shows reverse polarity, short circuit, over-voltage, over-current, overheat and over-discharge safeguards. Always confirm the clamp’s green indication before starting.</p>"}},
        "q6":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Can I use U32 in rain or rinse it clean?","answer":"<p>No. U32 is not waterproof. Keep the unit, clamp and ports dry; do not submerge or rinse the product.</p>"}}
